data: {"id": "b074d9467e7b41dc-thinking-parallel_evidence-1838", "run_id": "b074d9467e7b41dc", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 本轮调查事实汇总\n\n### 已确认事实（真实工具结果）\n\n1. **Pod 状态**：`aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 当前为 **Pending** 阶段，`containerStatus.reason = CreateContainerConfigError`，未进入 Running 状态。\n\n2. **根因证据**（来自 `kubectl describe` + `kubectl events`）：\n   - 事件原文：`Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input`\n   - 该错误在 52 分钟内重复了 12 次，说明 kubelet 持续失败。\n\n3. **Secret 验证**：\n   - Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` **存在**，类型为 `Opaque`。\n   - 其 `data_keys` 仅有：`available-key`\n   - Pod YAM", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 5, "ts_ms": 1788425321522, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

