data: {"id": "b074d9467e7b41dc-final", "run_id": "b074d9467e7b41dc", "seq": 1843, "ts_ms": 1788425338386, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` | CreateContainerConfigError | Pod aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2 处于 Pending 阶段，容器无法启动，状态为 CreateContainerConfigError |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | `Warning Failed ... kubelet Error: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input` | 直接指出容器启动失败原因，Kubelet 找不到指定 Key |\n| 2 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `container.waiting_reason`: CreateContainerConfigError, `container.waiting_message`: couldn't find key unavailable-key in Secret aiops-case-04/workload-input | 确认容器因配置错误处于等待状态，报错内容一致 |\n| 3 | K8s State | Kubernetes | `pod.phase`: Pending, `ContainersReady`: False, `RestartCount`: 0 | 确认 Pod 状态及容器未成功运行的事实 |\n| 4 | Metric | Prometheus | `kube_pod_container_status_waiting_reason` (reason=CreateContainerConfigError): 1 | 从指标层面确认该 Pod 的等待原因 |\n\n证据 1（K8s Event）与证据 2（K8s State）均指向同一核心错误，确认 Pod 处于 Pending 状态且容器无法启动是因为在 Secret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中找不到 `unavailable-key`。指标数据进一步在系统层面印证了这一状态。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\nSecret `aiops-case-04/workload-input` 中不存在 `unavailable-key` → Pod 容器配置请求注入不存在的密钥键 → Kubelet 注入配置失败 → 容器进入 CreateContainerConfigError 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认根因为 **Secret 键名引用错误**。Pod `aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2` 的容器配置中请求注入 `aiops-case-04/workload-input` Secret 中的 `unavailable-key`，但该 Secret 实际数据中仅包含 `available-key`，导致 Kubelet 无法注入该配置并拒绝启动容器（证据 1、证据 2）。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 22.1s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 55.2s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2: 55.2s (Evidence 45.6s, RCA 9.4s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 7.2s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-04/workload-6584f97c76-wvcb2**: pod-config-error\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 84.565, "metrics": {"run_id": "b074d9467e7b41dc", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 84.56949377059937, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-config-error", "pass": true, "score": 1.0, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.2}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-config-error"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 84569.49377059937, "llm_calls": 16, "llm_duration_ms": 77956.48622512817, "tool_calls": 16, "executed_tool_calls": 16, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 0, "successful_tool_calls": 15, "failed_tool_calls": 1, "tool_duration_ms": 14856.13226890564, "tool_wall_duration_ms": 6098.6034870147705}, "nodes": {"layer": {"name": "问题定位", "duration_ms": 22136.459827423096, "success": true}, "parallel_evidence": {"name": "并发证据采集", "duration_ms": 55191.78605079651, "success": true}, "evidence": {"name": "evidence", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "rca": {"name": "rca", "duration_ms": 0.0, "success": true}, "conclusion": {"name": "汇总总结", "duration_ms": 7216.8872356414795, "success": true}}, "success": true, "errors": []}}

